  _lines:
  - _characterName: Arthur
    _characterPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1329647001b79a14ca88b5585222b6c3, type: 3}
    _content: "Th\xE1m t\u1EED \u0111\u1EA5y \xE0? T\xF4i l\xE0 Arthur, qu\u1EA3n
      gia c\u1EE7a c\u0103n bi\u1EC7t th\u1EF1 n\xE0y."
  - _characterName: Arthur
    _characterPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1329647001b79a14ca88b5585222b6c3, type: 3}
    _content: "C\xE2y b\xFAt ng\u1ECDc b\xEDch gia b\u1EA3o c\u1EE7a ng\xE0i ch\u1EE7
      t\u1ECBch \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB m\u1EA5t tr\u1ED9m v\xE0o t\u1ED1i qua."
